# Save My Son (jeuno 5): the door _6t2 in Lower Jeuno, Shalott (and the Chocobo and Osker once completed) in Upper
# Jeuno, the Nightflowers of Qufim Island. The offer 164 (option 1: not begun; option 0: begun), the door's 229 and
# Shalott's 101 at Prog 0, the Nightflowers at noon (nil: its script's THESE_WITHERED_FLOWERS) and at 22:00 (0: Prog 1),
# then at Prog 1 (nil: NOW_THAT_NIGHT_HAS_FALLEN), Shalott's 44, the door's 163 (a full bag: not completed; with room:
# completed, 2100 gil, Beast Whistle, Life Saver, fame +7 x3), then the door's 132 and Shalott's 44 (replaceDefault),
# the chocobo's and Osker's 55 (Path of the Beastmaster not completed). A bone chip traded to the door while offered: no
# trade handler, nil.
# Chocobo's Wounds is set completed; its completed section answers the chocobo (61) and Osker (53) until this quest is
# completed. The harness starts at 12:00 Vana'diel; `wait vana=10` reaches 22:00 (clock time 2200 > 2130).
# Defaults: the door 64 (its script acts only for A New Dawn), Shalott 104; the Nightflowers' script messages.
lists LowerJeuno/_6t2/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Shalott/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Chocobo/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Osker/onTrigger QufimIsland/Nightflowers/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/164 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/163 QufimIsland/onEventFinish/0
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-80.7,-7.65,-168.8 lvl=30
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger _6t2                    # available: 164
finish option=1                 # not 0: not begun
trade _6t2 BoneChip x1          # available: no trade handler, nil (its script: nothing)
trigger _6t2                    # 164
finish option=0                 # begun
trigger _6t2                    # accepted, Prog 0: 229
finish
warp -49,8.2,87.2 UpperJeuno
trigger Shalott                 # Prog 0: 101
finish
trigger Chocobo                 # this quest not completed: Chocobo's Wounds' 61
finish
warp -263.3,-3.718,28.77 QufimIsland
trigger Nightflowers            # Prog 0 at noon: nil; its script's THESE_WITHERED_FLOWERS
wait vana=10                    # 22:00
trigger Nightflowers            # Prog 0 at night: 0
finish                          # Prog 1
trigger Nightflowers            # Prog 1: nil; NOW_THAT_NIGHT_HAS_FALLEN
warp -49,8.2,87.2 UpperJeuno
trigger Shalott                 # Prog 1: 44
finish
warp -80.7,-7.65,-168.8 LowerJeuno
trigger _6t2                    # Prog 1: 163
fill-inventory
finish                          # no room for the whistle: not completed
free-inventory
trigger _6t2                    # 163 again
finish                          # completed: 2100 gil, Beast Whistle, Life Saver, fame +7 x3
trigger _6t2                    # completed: 132 (replaceDefault)
finish
warp -49,8.2,87.2 UpperJeuno
trigger Shalott                 # completed: 44 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger Chocobo                 # Path of the Beastmaster not completed: 55 (Chocobo's Wounds' 61 needs this quest not completed)
finish
trigger Osker                   # 55
finish
